'''Celestial Child Luna''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 14.1 Update|Version 14.1]]. Similar to most other UBERFEST exclusives, Celestial Child Luna has very different stats between forms, providing different usage in various situations.

